## Tech stack

- Java 21 + Spring Boot 3.5 (via `org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-parent`)
- Maven build with quality gates in `verify`: Jacoco check (≥ 85 % line / ≥ 75 % branch per class), PIT (≥ 75 %), Surefire + Failsafe
- Jenkins CI (declarative pipeline)
- Helm chart for Kubernetes deployment
- Prometheus metrics on `{{contextPath}}/actuator/prometheus`

## Local build

```sh
./mvnw -q -DskipTests package   # build
./mvnw -q verify                 # tests + quality gates (as CI)
./mvnw spring-boot:run           # run locally on port {{appPort}}
```

The app exposes:

- `GET {{contextPath}}/actuator/health/liveness`
- `GET {{contextPath}}/actuator/health/readiness`
- `GET {{contextPath}}/actuator/prometheus`

